t;margin-bottom:\n0cm;margin-left:35.45pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-14.1pt;line-height:\nnormal;mso-pagination:none;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;text-autospace:none"><span style="mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">a.<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman Regular&quot;">Pembuatan\nBanner / poster Visi, Misi, dan Tujuan PS</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman Regular&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US"> y</span><span style="mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman Regular&quot;">ang ditempelkan di\nMasing-Masing Program Studi, ruang rapat, ruang kelas, ruang tutorial,\nlaboratorium terpadu, laboratorium komputer dan perpustakaan, ruang aula, unit<span style="letter-spacing:-.1pt"> </span>kerja<span style="letter-spacing:-.05pt"> </span>masing-masing<span style="letter-spacing:-.1pt"> </span>(Perpustakaan,<span style="letter-spacing:\n-.2pt"> </span>Laboratorium,<span style="letter-spacing:-.05pt"> </span>Bagian<span style="letter-spacing:-.15pt"> </span>akademik<span style="letter-spacing:-.1pt">\n</span>dan kemahasiswaan, <i style="mso-bidi-font-style:normal">Front office</i>,\nruang tamu, <i style="mso-bidi-font-style:normal">pantry</i>, pos satpam)</span></p>\n\n<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-top:.1pt;margin-right:-.2pt;margin-bottom:\n0cm;margin-left:35.45pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-14.1pt;line-height:\nnormal;mso-pagination:none;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;text-autospace:none"><span style="mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-famil